th\">Restore from a backup file</label><input id=\"restore-path\" type=\"text\" data-testid=\"settings-restore-path\" placeholder=\"path shown by Export profile data\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"btn-row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--quiet\" data-testid=\"settings-restore-check\" disabled=\"\">Check a backup…</button></div><div class=\"btn-row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--quiet\">Switch profile…</button></div><details class=\"prose-note\"><summary>Switching deletes nothing: each profile keeps its own data and waits for you in the picker.</summary><p><small data-testid=\"settings-switch-note\">Switching deletes nothing: each profile keeps its own progress, saved words, and settings, and waits for you in the picker.</small></p></details><div class=\"btn-row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--quiet\">Delete profile data…</button></div><details class=\"prose-note\"><summary>Deleting is final: one explicit confirmation, then all of the profile&#x27;s local data on this device is gone.</summary><p><small data-testid=\"settings-delete-note\">Deleting removes this profile and all of its learning data on this device, and cannot be undone. The app asks for one explicit confirmation before anything is deleted.</small></p></details></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>Speech</h3><p class=\"meta pack-posture\" data-aligner=\"no\" data-testid=\"settings-speech-readiness\">Microphone: off — speaking activities abstain and nothing is recorded. Speech model: off — speaking checks say so instead of guessing. Speech runtime: status could not be read.</p><label for=\"speech-model\">Active speech model<select id=\"speech-model\"><option value=\"off\" selected=\"\">Off — speaking activities abstain</option><option value=\"org.openlanguage.speech.whisper-ggml-tiny\">org.openlanguage.speech.whisper-ggml-tiny — v1.0.0, MIT (not downloaded)</option></select></label><details class=\"prose-note\"><summary>This is the app&#x27;s one speech-model preference; the mo